      "why": "A row that fills the window exactly, with the canonical cursor in the last column and a wrap pending. The last cell is drawn and nothing wraps, and the pending wrap is reported rather than reproduced: every cursor placement clears one, so a renderer that places the cursor cannot leave a destination in it.",
